 anyways&#8230; <\/p>\n<h3>Shuttle Can Touch the Line During a Serve<\/h3>\n<p>The 2 pictures above show you the area you&#8217;re suppose to serve to in a singles (1st Picture) or doubles (2nd picture: click on it to enlarge) badminton game. <\/p>\n<p>Your badminton service should land anywhere INSIDE the grey area. <\/p>\n<p>As for your question, if the shuttlecock lands on the lines of the grey area, your service is still considered to be INSIDE.<\/p>\n<p>When a shuttlecock lands, the head of the shuttle will touch the ground first. <\/p>\n<p>As long as the shuttle touches ANY part of the line, it is considered in. <\/p>\n<h3>Server must NOT stand on the line<\/h3>\n<p>As for the player delivering the badminton serve, he or she must serve from her service box. <\/p>\n<p>The server must be standing inside the service box when delivering the service. Your feet must NOT step on the borderlines when delivering a serve.<\/p>\n<p>The following are similar questions asked by our visitors. <\/p>\n<p><a href=\"if-the-shuttle-touches-the-line-of-short-box-or-long-box-will-it-be-in-or-out.html\">If the shuttle touches the line of the service box, will it be IN or OUT?<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"if-the-cocks-touches-the-outer-edge-of-the-outer-line-then-it-is-out-or-in.html\">If the shuttlecock touches the outer edge of the outer line, is it IN or OUT?<\/a><\/p><\/div>\n<table id=\"comments\" class=\"tblerem\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:450px;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        Comments for Is serving while standing on the line right or wrong?<br \/><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\">\n      \tAverage Rating <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" alt=\"star\"\/><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/02\/star2.gif\" class=\"rstars\" width=\"14\" 